# Registers DbUnitTestExecutionListener as one of the default test execution listeners of the
# Spring TestContext Framework, so a test class that keeps Spring's defaults gets it even when
# another @TestExecutionListeners declaration wins over the one @DbUnitSpringTest carries. The
# listener does nothing for a test that uses no org.dbunit.annotation annotation.
org.springframework.test.context.TestExecutionListener=\
org.dbunit.spring.DbUnitTestExecutionListener
